  "dataset_facts": {
    "samples": "672 unique developing neocortex samples, 654 with genotype+RNA after QC, 4-39 PCW (Tri1 N=216, Tri2 N=433 across ancestries); EUR N=292, AMR 164, AFR 145, SEA 29, EA 24",
